{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no more land left to bury the dead. Meanwhile, the planet is drowning in trash, car exhaust, and oil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the strange happenings on the beach of a once-top resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/4aa5a896b2bfecab3d74d2bbb4ddf10d.poster.avif?t=1757685520\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/4aa5a896b2bfecab3d74d2bbb4ddf10d.webm?t=1757685520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/4aa5a896b2bfecab3d74d2bbb4ddf10d.mp4?t=1757685520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a bot, a beach cleaner and trash sorter named S.A.N.D.Y. - Sweeper &amp; Neutralizer of Debris (Yours). For your happiness, it's enough that human eyeglasses stay on your camera. And year after year, you work diligently, no matter what. Thank you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/4bb51406fac672fcd1f33d1cf61ac260.poster.avif?t=1757685520\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/4bb51406fac672fcd1f33d1cf61ac260.webm?t=1757685520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/4bb51406fac672fcd1f33d1cf61ac260.mp4?t=1757685520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the marked beach area \u2192 The bot is running out of storage \u2192 Sort the collected trash for disposal \u2192 Rescue the animals \u2192 A new area  is unlocked \u2192 Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the game to see environments change, stories unfold, and collect valuable items and rescued animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/c829a9eec4d211e10f9ed067a905c2b8.poster.avif?t=1757685520\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/c829a9eec4d211e10f9ed067a905c2b8.webm?t=1757685520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/extras/c829a9eec4d211e10f9ed067a905c2b8.mp4?t=1757685520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954990?t=1757685520","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/cea94327f87d0f94fb47a9cc06f99c98f1d1b295/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757685520","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/0625d16b547a49dddeb54bd635c6a7c7229a1015/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757685520","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954990/0625d16b547a49dddeb54bd635c6a7c7229a1015/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757685520","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"